      "families": ["cryo", "emp", "psionic", "magnetic"],
      "note": "Exception to decision 5B (Mustafa, 13 November 2026; question HC, answer A). Decision 5B allows stuns only from T2, kept short and on a medium or longer cooldown. Weapons of the cryo, emp, psionic and magnetic families may freeze or stop a target at any tier and without a cooldown, because a weapon has no cooldown. Of 5B, only the rule that the card states the victim's escape applies to them (HC7)."
